DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART:20260130T203000Z
DTEND:20260130T210000Z
SUMMARY:Month-End Rebalance Reminder
DESCRIPTION:Custom reminder for final regular trading session of the month.
  Actual institutional flows are not known or guaranteed\; this is not an o
 fficial index event. Holiday-adjusted using Cboe regular-session calendar.
URL:https://www.cboe.com/about/hours/us-options/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
