DTSTART:20260320T193000Z
DTEND:20260320T200000Z
SUMMARY:SPX / NDX Rebalance Close (Expected)
DESCRIPTION:Rule-based reminder for the closing session before scheduled in
 dex adjustments\; not a confirmed announcement or a forecast of trading fl
 ows. If third Friday is closed\, previous session is a planning assumption
 . Check official notices. S&P 500 share updates are quarterly\; membership
  changes may occur at any time. Sources: https://www.spglobal.com/spdji/en
 /documents/methodologies/methodology-sp-us-indices.pdf \; https://www.spgl
 obal.com/spdji/en/documents/methodologies/methodology-sp-equity-indices-po
